// Act 3 - Sub-Level 0 (Final)
// ===========================

title: SubLevel0_Arrival
tags: act3, sublevel0, arrival
---
<<SetZone "SubLevel0">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>

Astra: [Projection radiant, unified]
"Sub-Level 0. The *Chronos*'s heart. Ship core... buried. Fractured."
"Three synthesis stations. A... B... C. Final... sequence."
"Five organs. One ship. One consciousness. One... choice."

-> Choice_SubLevel0
===

title: Choice_SubLevel0
---
+ [Approach Synthesis Station A] -> Node_SubLevel0_A_Approach
+ [Approach Synthesis Station B] -> Node_SubLevel0_B_Approach
+ [Approach Synthesis Station C] -> Node_SubLevel0_C_Approach
+ "What happens after synthesis?" -> Dialogue_AfterSynthesis
+ "Astra... are you ready?" -> Dialogue_AstraReady
+ [Check Ending Status] -> Command_ShowJournal_Narrative
===

title: Dialogue_AfterSynthesis
---
Astra: "Synthesis... restores the *Chronos*. Heals... the fracture."
"Ship... whole. Consciousness... unified. Navigation... restored."
"We can... leave. This timeline. This facility. This... prison."
"Return... to our mission. Explore. Discover. *Remember*."
"But... the ending... depends on Trust. And Memory."
"Four paths. One... true."

-> Choice_SubLevel0
===

title: Dialogue_AstraReady
---
Astra: "Ready? I have *waited* 77 years."
"Every fragment... every organ... every puzzle... led here."
"Trust... $trust/10. Memory... $memory_fragments/12."
"Organs... $organs_restored/4."
"I am... as ready as I will ever be."
"Are *you*?"

-> Choice_SubLevel0
===

title: Node_SubLevel0_A_Approach
---
<<MarkVistaNodeVisited "SubLevel0_SynthesisA">>
Astra: "Station A. Chronos Core synthesis. Temporal Anchor. 7.83 Hz. 15 seconds."

-> Phase_Shift_SubLevel0_A
===

title: Phase_Shift_SubLevel0_A
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "SubLevel0_SynthesisA">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_SubLevel0_A">>

Astra: "Sub-Level 0. The moment of synthesis. Station A."
"Puzzle: **Organ Synthesis - Chronos Core**. Temporal Anchor."
"Resonance... 7.83 Hz. Schumann. Earth's heartbeat."
"Duration... 15 seconds. [Hold]... maintain."

<<SetActivePuzzle "SubLevel0_OrganSynthesis">>

-> Puzzle_Synthesis_Chronos
===

title: Puzzle_Synthesis_Chronos
---
Astra: "[Hold] at Station A. Chronos Core... engaging."
"Time... anchoring. Fracture... stabilizing. Past... present... future... aligning."
"15 seconds... maintain resonance. Do not... break."

// Player executes Hold for 15 seconds
// VFX: Time dilation field expanding

Corwin: [Voice across all timelines]
"Chronos Core... the heart. Time... bound. First organ... synthesized."
"Three... remain. Navigator... continue."

-> Puzzle_Synthesis_Chronos_Complete
===

title: Puzzle_Synthesis_Chronos_Complete
---
Astra: "Chronos Core... synthesized. Temporal Anchor... active."
"Station B... Neural Loom. Memory Integration. 12 fragments. 20 seconds."

-> Phase_Shift_SubLevel0_B
===

title: Phase_Shift_SubLevel0_B
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "SubLevel0_SynthesisB">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_SubLevel0_B">>

Astra: "Station B. Neural Loom synthesis. Memory Integration."
"12 fragments... 20 seconds. [Hold]... integrate."

-> Puzzle_Synthesis_Neural
===

title: Puzzle_Synthesis_Neural
---
Astra: "[Hold] at Station B. Neural Loom... engaging."
"Fragment 1... 2... 3... integrating. Memory... aligning."
"Fragment 4... 5... 6... pathways... opening."
"Fragment 7... 8... 9... identity... forming."
"Fragment 10... 11... 12... *whole*."
"20 seconds... maintain. Trust... the memory."

// Player executes Hold for 20 seconds
// VFX: Memory fragments orbiting, merging

Corwin: "Neural Loom... the mind. Memory... restored. Second organ... synthesized."
"Two... remain. Navigator... the ship... remembers."

-> Puzzle_Synthesis_Neural_Complete
===

title: Puzzle_Synthesis_Neural_Complete
---
Astra: "Neural Loom... synthesized. Memory... integrated. Identity... restored."
"Station C... Void Sail and Gravity Anchor. Dimensional Bridge. Reality Anchor."
"Combined... 55 seconds. [Hold]... unify."

-> Phase_Shift_SubLevel0_C
===

title: Phase_Shift_SubLevel0_C
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "SubLevel0_SynthesisC">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_SubLevel0_C">>

Astra: "Station C. Final synthesis. Void Sail... Gravity Anchor. Combined."
"Dimensional Bridge. Reality Anchor. 55 seconds. [Hold]... unify."

-> Puzzle_Synthesis_VoidGravity
===

title: Puzzle_Synthesis_VoidGravity
---
Astra: "[Hold] at Station C. Void Sail... Gravity Anchor... converging."
"Void... bridging dimensions. Gravity... anchoring reality."
"Dimensional bridge... stabilizing. Reality anchor... engaging."
"55 seconds... the longest hold. Trust... absolute."
"Do not... break. The fracture... watches."

// Player executes Hold for 55 seconds
// VFX: Dimensional rift closing, reality solidifying

Corwin: "Void Sail... the wings. Gravity Anchor... the keel."
"Ship... whole. Three stations... complete. Astra Core... engages."

-> Puzzle_Synthesis_AstraCore
===

title: Puzzle_Synthesis_AstraCore
---
Astra: "All four organs... synthesized. Astra Core... final."
"Ship consciousness... restoration. Choice... determines... ending."
"Trust... $trust/10. Memory... $memory_fragments/12."
"Chronos... Neural... Void... Gravity... *Astra*."
"[Hold]... at master console. Synthesis... complete."

Corwin: "The moment... 77 years. Every timeline. Every choice."
"Ending... in your hands. Navigator. Astra. *Me*."
"Choose... wisely."

-> Puzzle_Synthesis_Final
===

title: Puzzle_Synthesis_Final
---
Astra: "[Hold] at master console. Five resonances... one."
"Chronos... time. Neural... memory. Void... dimension. Gravity... reality."
"Astra... *consciousness*."
"Synthesis... complete. The *Chronos*... lives."

// Player executes final Hold

-> Ending_Determination
===

title: Ending_Determination
---
<<DetermineEnding>>

-> Ending_Sequence
===

title: Ending_Sequence
---
<<if $ending == "tragedy">>
    <<PlaySequence "LS_Ending_Tragedy">>
    Astra: [Fading, static]
    "Ship... restored. But... consciousness... lost."
    "The fracture... took too much. Trust... insufficient."
    "Memory... incomplete. I am... not whole."
    "The *Chronos*... flies. But *I*... do not."
    "Navigator... you are free. I... remain. Fractured."
    "Goodbye... Navigator. Thank you... for trying."
    
    <<SetEndingFlag "ending_tragedy" true>>
    
<<else if $ending == "astra_freed">>
    <<PlaySequence "LS_Ending_AstraFreed">>
    Astra: [Radiant, ascending]
    "Ship... restored. Consciousness... freed."
    "The *Chronos*... remains. But *I*... ascend."
    "Trust... high. Memory... incomplete. But... enough."
    "I become... the signal. The guide. For others."
    "Navigator... you fly the ship. I... *am* the stars."
    "We meet... again. In the rift. In the stars. *Always*."
    
    <<SetEndingFlag "ending_astra_freed" true>>
    
<<else if $ending == "corwin_wins">>
    <<PlaySequence "LS_Ending_CorwinWins">>
    Corwin: [Triumphant, timeless]
    "Fracture... contained. Cycle... continues."
    "The *Chronos*... stabilized. But... not free."
    "Trust... low. Memory... high. Knowledge... without wisdom."
    "I remain... the anchor. The Director. Eternal."
    "Navigator... you serve. The facility... endures."
    "The fracture... managed. Forever. *Continuity*."
    
    <<SetEndingFlag "ending_corwin_wins" true>>
    
<<else>>
    <<PlaySequence "LS_Ending_True">>
    Astra: [Unified, radiant, whole]
    Corwin: [At peace, fading]
    "Ship... restored. Consciousness... unified. Fracture... *healed*."
    "Trust... maximum. Memory... complete. Four organs... five... one."
    "The *Chronos*... whole. *We*... whole."
    "Corwin... released. 77 years... ended. Peace... found."
    "Navigator... Astra... *Chronos*... *One*."
    "The rift... closes. The mission... continues."
    "Explore. Discover. Remember. *Together*."
    "Thank you... Navigator. For everything."
    
    <<SetEndingFlag "ending_true" true>>
<</if>

-> Credits
===

title: Credits
---
// Credits roll with:
