// - Memory fragments collected display
// - Trust level achieved
// - Ending achieved
// - Playtime
// - New Game+ unlock notification

Astra: [Post-credits, if True Ending]
"New Game+... unlocked. Trust... retained. Memory... retained."
"New choices... new paths. The fracture... remembers."
"Navigator... shall we... begin again?"

-> END
===